=========================================================================================================
14_export_folds.py — Export of the shared outer folds for the TensorFlow steps
=========================================================================================================

~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
[EXPLAIN] What this step does
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  The audit of the original deep network (steps 15-17) runs in a separate Python environment with
  TensorFlow. So that         the network is scored on exactly the same molecules as the classical
  ensembles and the D-MPNN, this step writes the         25 outer folds (random and scaffold-
  grouped) and the 15% hold-out split of step 04 to a table keyed by compound ID.         Nothing
  is trained here.
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  random    folds=25 | test size min=171 max=172 | repeats=5
  scaffold  folds=25 | test size min=165 max=189 | repeats=5
  holdout   dev=730 | test=129

